title: "Knota: A General-Purpose AI-Based Skill Assessment and Learner Modelling Framework"
type: generic
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-02

authors:
  - family-names: "Hirose"
    given-names: "Yuhei"

abstract: >
  Knota is an experimental AI-native framework for estimating learner
  capability through AI-generated assessments, rubric-based semantic
  evaluation, multidimensional learner-state estimation, uncertainty
  modelling, and adaptive assessment policies. The long-term research
  objective is to investigate whether a shared learner model can
  generalise across heterogeneous knowledge domains.

keywords:
  - learner modelling
  - knowledge tracing
  - adaptive learning
  - artificial intelligence
  - large language models
  - educational technology
  - psychometrics
  - adaptive assessment
  - skill assessment

